# Architecture

- Product: interactive technical knowledge engine (not a docs site).
- Content is data under `src/content/`; diagrams are pure `f(props)` under `src/components/diagrams/`.
- Do not hardcode multi-step narratives only in page components.
- Prefer extending existing player/types over new frameworks.
- Architectural changes need an ADR in `docs/decisions/`.
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/architecture.md`.
- Skills live in `skills/`; load only relevant ones (`docs/skills.md`).
